      "evidence": "The excluded population named and sized, with a reason it is lower risk that does not depend on the current data holding. The confirmed fraud sitting inside the population you are about to exclude, which is rarely zero. The effect on recall. And a standing monitoring signal on the excluded population, so the exclusion cannot silently become a hole.",
