      "risk": "Segmentation multiplies the estate. Four segments means four thresholds, four monitoring series, four review cycles and four ways to be out of date. It also creates a fairness surface. If a segment maps closely onto a vulnerable or protected group, differential friction becomes a conduct question rather than a tuning question, and it has to be checked explicitly rather than assumed away.",
